IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER:

This software generates basic floor plan layouts for conceptual and educational
purposes only. The generated plans:

- Are NOT construction-ready documents
- Have NOT been validated against local building codes
- May NOT meet structural, fire safety, or accessibility requirements
- Should NOT be used for actual construction without review by a licensed architect

Always consult with licensed professionals (architects, engineers, contractors)
before using any generated plans for construction purposes.

The authors and contributors of this software assume no liability for any
damages, injuries, or losses resulting from the use of generated floor plans.
